BT /F1 9 Tf 40 800 Td 12 TL (Technical Specifications \(continued\)) ' () ' (1. Miniature Circuit Breakers shall conform to IS/IEC 60898-1, with a breaking capacity not less than 10) ' (kA, C-curve characteristics, and shall be DIN rail mounted.) ' () ' (2. Residual Current Circuit Breakers shall conform to IS 12640 \(Part 1\), with a sensitivity of 30 mA for) ' (final circuits and 100 mA for sub-main circuits.) ' () ' (3. Moulded Case Circuit Breakers shall conform to IS/IEC 60947-2, with thermal-magnetic release, rated) ' (service breaking capacity Ics = 100% Icu.) ' () ' (4. LT XLPE armoured cables shall conform to IS 7098 \(Part 1\), with aluminium conductors, 1.1 kV grade,) ' (galvanised steel strip armour and PVC outer sheath.) ' () ' (5. FRLS PVC insulated copper wires shall conform to IS 694, 1.1 kV grade, multi-strand, with flame) ' (retardant low smoke sheathing.) ' () ' (6. Distribution boards shall be double door, powder coated, with IP 42 protection, complete with busbar,) ' (neutral link and earth bar.) ' () ' (7. LED luminaires shall conform to IS 10322, with power factor above 0.95, THD below 10%, and a minimum) ' (efficacy of 100 lumens per watt.) ' () ' (8. Earthing shall be carried out as per IS 3043 using copper plate or GI pipe electrodes with charcoal) ' (and salt, and earth resistance shall not exceed 1 ohm.) ' () ' (9. Miniature Circuit Breakers shall conform to IS/IEC 60898-1, with a breaking capacity not less than 10) ' (kA, C-curve characteristics, and shall be DIN rail mounted.) ' () ' ET BT /F1 8 Tf 280 25 Td (Page 11 of 150) Tj ET
