BT /F1 9 Tf 40 800 Td 12 TL (Bidder's Undertaking and Declarations) ' () ' (1. The Contractor shall comply with all applicable laws, statutory rules and regulations in force,) ' (including the Indian Electricity Rules and the Central Electricity Authority \(Measures relating to Safety) ' (and Electric Supply\) Regulations.) ' (2. All materials shall be new, of the best quality, and shall conform to the latest relevant Indian) ' (Standard Specifications, with BIS marking wherever applicable.) ' (3. The Engineer-in-Charge shall have full powers to reject any material or work that does not conform to) ' (the specifications, and the Contractor shall remove such material from site at his own cost.) ' (4. Payment shall be made within 30 days of receipt of the bill duly certified by the Engineer-in-Charge,) ' (subject to deduction of statutory taxes at source.) ' (5. The defect liability period shall be twelve months from the date of completion. Any defect noticed) ' (during this period shall be rectified by the Contractor free of cost.) ' (6. Liquidated damages at the rate of 0.5% of the contract value per week of delay, subject to a maximum) ' (of 10%, shall be levied for delay attributable to the Contractor.) ' ET BT /F1 8 Tf 280 25 Td (Page 146 of 150) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
